{"tier": "glm-5.2", "verse": 10, "ref": "2-chronicles 10:10", "book": "2-chronicles", "lang": "pcm", "chapter": 10, "translation": "And ⟨את⟩ di young men wey grow up ⟨את⟩ am talk to am, sey, \"Like dis you go tell di people wey talk to you, sey, 'Ya papa make ⟨את⟩ our yoke heavy, but you, make light from on top us.' Like dis you go tell dem: 'My small finger thick pass my papa waist.'\"", "tokens": [{"surface": "וידברו", "gloss": "And dem talk"}, {"surface": "אתו", "gloss": "⟨את⟩"}, {"surface": "הילדים", "gloss": "di young men"}, {"surface": "אשר", "gloss": "wey"}, {"surface": "גדלו", "gloss": "grow up"}, {"surface": "אתו", "gloss": "⟨את⟩"}, {"surface": "לאמר", "gloss": "sey"}, {"surface": "כה", "gloss": "like dis"}, {"surface": "תאמר", "gloss": "you go tell"}, {"surface": "לעם", "gloss": "di people"}, {"surface": "אשר", "gloss": "wey"}, {"surface": "דברו", "gloss": "talk"}, {"surface": "אליך", "gloss": "to you"}, {"surface": "לאמר", "gloss": "sey"}, {"surface": "אביך", "gloss": "ya papa"}, {"surface": "הכביד", "gloss": "make heavy"}, {"surface": "את", "gloss": "⟨את⟩", "marks": "our yoke"}, {"surface": "עלנו", "gloss": "our yoke"}, {"surface": "ואתה", "gloss": "but you"}, {"surface": "הקל", "gloss": "make light"}, {"surface": "מעלינו", "gloss": "from on top us"}, {"surface": "כה", "gloss": "like dis"}, {"surface": "תאמר", "gloss": "you go tell"}, {"surface": "אלהם", "gloss": "dem"}, {"surface": "קטני", "gloss": "my small finger"}, {"surface": "עבה", "gloss": "thick"}, {"surface": "ממתני", "gloss": "pass waist"}, {"surface": "אבי", "gloss": "my papa"}], "timestamp": "2026-08-11T14:07:39.861478523Z", "model": "glm-5.2"}